      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Guest sign in\n- username is used for sign in.\ncannot be changed. normalized to\nlowercase, no symbols except\nunderscore and period. letters and\nnumbers allowed\n- use passport-local instead of\njwt in case i want to add remove\nall sessions after updating\npassword (see below)\n\nPossible future improvements:\n- Signup with email (should be\nvalidated that the email exists\nand it's owned by the user) to\nallow password reset via sending\nOTP\n- signup/login with google,\nfacebook, etc.",
      "fontSize": 19.932356257046223,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Guest sign in\n- username is used for sign in. cannot be changed. normalized to lowercase, no symbols except underscore and period. letters and numbers allowed\n- use passport-local instead of jwt in case i want to add remove all sessions after updating password (see below)\n\nPossible future improvements:\n- Signup with email (should be validated that the email exists and it's owned by the user) to allow password reset via sending OTP\n- signup/login with google, facebook, etc.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
