      "updated": 1792736661676,
      "created": 1792733810894,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- user must pick a movie/show\nfrom their watch list. shouldn't\nmatter if they have completed it\nor not.\n- review score are based off\nWATCH LIST score\n- reviews can be exported\n- reviews should be editable in\ncase they want to update their\nopinions on a particular media as\nthey go through it. should display\nlast updated at and the review\ncreation date.\n- users cannot post multiple\nreviews for the same show. users\nshould only be allowed to update\ntheir review\n- posts are sorted by new\n- reviews are always public\n- users can like a post (limit to\n99+ when displaying in frontend\nfor now)\n\n- users can comment on a post or\ncomment on another comment.\nshould reset the root comment in\nfrontend on a particular depth like\nin reddit ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- user must pick a movie/show from their watch list. shouldn't matter if they have completed it or not.\n- review score are based off WATCH LIST score\n- reviews can be exported\n- reviews should be editable in case they want to update their opinions on a particular media as they go through it. should display last updated at and the review creation date.\n- users cannot post multiple reviews for the same show. users should only be allowed to update their review\n- posts are sorted by new\n- reviews are always public\n- users can like a post (limit to 99+ when displaying in frontend for now)\n\n- users can comment on a post or comment on another comment. should reset the root comment in frontend on a particular depth like in reddit ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
