    {
      "id": "Ygl4XLdHSmCh7r9A4oJiw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1111.248970551506,
      "y": 706.4663190529875,
      "width": 338.81684388652053,
      "height": 996.6178128523111,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "7mdlnO5LiPT1ZXmnXsys9"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1191322397,
      "version": 5069,
      "versionNonce": 934146675,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792738195025,
      "created": 1792736352664,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- should be able to add watch\ngroup name\n- allows full outer join watch list\ncomparison for each watch group\nmember ordered by score of the\nviewing user\n- watch group should have a score\nfilter and show/movie search\n- can add different connections to\nwatch group. users must accept\nthe watch group request for them\nto join\n- should show member status e.g.\naccepted or pending. if a user\nrejects, it should just delete the\nrow of that user in the database\n- allow creation of different watch\ngroups composing of different\nconnections. \n- creator of watch group is the\nadmin. can kick, add more members,\nand rename group\n\nNOTE TO SELF:\n- this will allow watch group\nrequests even if members are not\nconsidered as connections to one\nanother (only based off admin\nconnection)\n- could violate privacy of a user's\nwatch list since it should only be\nable to be viewed by other users\nwhom they have a connection\nwith.\n- for now, treat watch group\nsimilar as connection request. idk\nif there's a better way of handling\nthis because validating each\nmember's connection is..\nquestionable imo",
      "fontSize": 19.932356257046223,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- should be able to add watch group name\n- allows full outer join watch list comparison for each watch group member ordered by score of the viewing user\n- watch group should have a score filter and show/movie search\n- can add different connections to watch group. users must accept the watch group request for them to join\n- should show member status e.g. accepted or pending. if a user rejects, it should just delete the row of that user in the database\n- allow creation of different watch groups composing of different connections. \n- creator of watch group is the admin. can kick, add more members, and rename group\n\nNOTE TO SELF:\n- this will allow watch group requests even if members are not considered as connections to one another (only based off admin connection)\n- could violate privacy of a user's watch list since it should only be able to be viewed by other users whom they have a connection with.\n- for now, treat watch group similar as connection request. idk if there's a better way of handling this because validating each member's connection is.. questionable imo",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
